# Assistant content: a thinking (reasoning) step renders as a dim
# "thinking ────" block: collapsed to a one-line summary with a ctrl+o
# hint, expanded to the full reasoning on ctrl+o, collapsed again on the
# next ctrl+o (internal/tui/transcript.go RenderThinking).
@faux testdata/faux/qa/content-thinking.yaml
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT welcome
TYPE explain the change
KEY enter
WAITFOR /I'll use a fixed window counter/ 20
SHOT reply-collapsed
EXPECT /thinking ─/
EXPECT /fixed window, not a sliding one.*…/
EXPECT_NOT /zremrangebyscore/
EXPECT_NOT /∴/
KEY ctrl+o
WAITFOR /zremrangebyscore/ 10
SHOT after-ctrl-o-expand
EXPECT /only implements zremrangebyscore/
KEY ctrl+o
WAIT 1
SHOT after-ctrl-o-collapse
EXPECT_NOT /zremrangebyscore/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
